{'symbol': 'UDR', 'date': '2023-03-02 16:16:00', 'title': 'UDR TO PARTICIPATE IN CITI GLOBAL PROPERTY CEO CONFERENCE', 'text': 'DENVER--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UDR, INC. (THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: UDR), A LEADING MULTIFAMILY REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST AND A GRESB 5 STAR RATED COMPANY FOR ITS SUSTAINABILITY LEADERSHIP, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THOMAS W. TOOMEY, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND THE UDR EXECUTIVE TEAM WILL HOST A ROUNDTABLE DISCUSSION AT THE 2023 CITI GLOBAL PROPERTY CEO CONFERENCE IN HOLLYWOOD, FLORIDA, ON MONDAY, MARCH 6, 2023, AT 3:40 P.M. EASTERN TIME.'}